      "writtenOn": "2025-11-03T19:27:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think one of the issues with adding a `Ref\u003cPipeline\u003e` in `BindGroupLayoutBase` is because that would introduce a ref-cycle: `Pipeline` refs `PipelineLayout` refs `BindGroupLayout` refs `Pipeline`. In theory this could be broken if we make `Pipeline`s ref counted with external ref, but we probably just didn\u0027t want to do that at the time since we didn\u0027t immediately have a need for it.",
      "parentUuid": "1990d158_7e925aa7",
      "revId": "43be1a4dda86f981fab9ca598571a322770dc816",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
